[32.093472, "o", "\r\n"]
[32.09359, "o", "\r\n"]
[32.09375, "o", "Our experimental scheme is sketched in Fig. 1. We create a QRM Hamiltonian with bichromatic Raman laser"]
[32.093863, "o", "\r\n"]
[32.093986, "o", "beams on a single trapped 171 Yb+ ion27,30 (see Methods)"]
